{"seq":1,"slug":"two-phase-commit-internals","title":"2PC 内部机制：协调者、参与者与阻塞窗口","url":"/l-doc-books/h/backend-engineering/distributed-transaction-consistency-patterns/commit-protocols-2pc-tcc/two-phase-commit-internals","wordCount":2504,"readingTime":11,"html":"<h1 id=\"2pc-内部机制-协调者-参与者与阻塞窗口\">2PC 内部机制：协调者、参与者与阻塞窗口</h1><p>两阶段提交（2PC）被讲滥的一句话是「它的一致性靠协议保证」。真正决定它能不能用的，不是那句抽象结论，而是<strong>一个已经投了赞成票的参与者，在收到最终决定之前，它手上的行锁会锁多久</strong>——这个时间窗口（本文称之为阻塞窗口）才是 2PC 在生产环境里唯一的成本项。PostgreSQL 官方文档用近乎警告的语气提醒：已 prepare 的事务「会继续持有它原本持有的所有锁」，长期搁置会阻碍 <code>VACUUM</code> 回收存储，极端情况下数据库会为防止事务 ID 回卷而关机（<a href=\"https://www.postgresql.org/docs/current/sql-prepare-transaction.html\">PostgreSQL PREPARE TRANSACTION</a>）。理解 2PC，就是把这个窗口拆开、度量、再收缩。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>2PC 是一种<strong>原子提交协议（Atomic Commitment Protocol, ACP）</strong>：它协调所有参与分布式事务的进程，就「整体提交还是整体回滚」达成一致决定。节点分两类——一个被指定的<strong>协调者（coordinator）</strong>（主站点），其余是<strong>参与者（participant）</strong>（<a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Two-phase_commit_protocol\">Two-phase commit protocol, Wikipedia</a>）。协议分两阶段：</p>\n<ol>\n<li><strong>投票阶段（prepare）</strong>：协调者问每个参与者「你能不能提交」，参与者各自写 undo/redo 日志，本地工作成功则投赞成票（Yes），否则投反对票（No）。</li>\n<li><strong>决定阶段（commit）</strong>：只要有一票反对就广播回滚，全票赞成才广播提交。参与者收到决定后提交并释放资源，或撤销并释放资源，然后回执。</li>\n</ol>\n<p>关键点在于<strong>参与者投出赞成票的那一刻，它已经失去了单方面脱身的能力</strong>。投 No 很安全——协调者必然全局回滚；投 Yes 则意味着「我已把锁和数据落盘，只能等你裁决」。若协调者在此后失效，参与者就进入<strong>不确定态（in-doubt）</strong>：既不能自作主张提交（可能别人要回滚），也不能自作主张回滚（可能别人已提交）。这正是维基百科对 2PC 的核心评价：<strong>2PC 最大的缺点是它是一个阻塞协议</strong>，一旦协调者永久失效，某些参与者的事务将永远无法自行了结（<a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Two-phase_commit_protocol\">Wikipedia</a>）。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>维度</th>\n<th>单机事务</th>\n<th>2PC 分布式事务</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>提交决策方</td>\n<td>本地存储引擎</td>\n<td>外部协调者（TM）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>失败后的可知性</td>\n<td>崩溃即干净回滚</td>\n<td>参与者可能处于 in-doubt</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>资源持有时间</td>\n<td>事务全程</td>\n<td>从 prepare 起直到收到最终决定</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>核心风险</td>\n<td>死锁、长事务</td>\n<td><strong>协调者单点 + 阻塞窗口</strong></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"协调者与参与者的角色分工\">协调者与参与者的角色分工</h2><p>在 X/Open XA 规范里，这两个角色的名字是<strong>事务管理器（Transaction Manager, TM）<strong>与</strong>资源管理器（Resource Manager, RM）</strong>。MySQL 的实现给出了直白的映射：服务器充当 RM（参与方），连接它的客户端程序充当 TM（协调方）——「连接 MySQL 服务器的客户端程序扮演事务管理器」（<a href=\"https://dev.mysql.com/doc/refman/8.4/en/xa.html\">MySQL 8.4 XA Transactions</a>）。这意味着<strong>协调者常常不是一台专门服务器，而就是业务进程本身</strong>；一旦业务进程崩溃，它的角色必须被接管，否则参与方永久卡住。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;  TM[协调者 / TM&lt;br/&gt;发起 · 收集投票 · 广播决定 · 持久化日志]&#10;  RM1[参与者 1 / RM · 本地库 A&lt;br/&gt;写 undo/redo · 持锁等待]&#10;  RM2[参与者 2 / RM · 本地库 B&lt;br/&gt;写 undo/redo · 持锁等待]&#10;  RM3[参与者 3 / RM · 消息队列&lt;br/&gt;写日志 · 持锁等待]&#10;  TM --&gt;|Phase 1: prepare?| RM1&#10;  TM --&gt;|Phase 1: prepare?| RM2&#10;  TM --&gt;|Phase 1: prepare?| RM3&#10;  RM1 --&gt;|vote Yes/No| TM&#10;  RM2 --&gt;|vote Yes/No| TM&#10;  RM3 --&gt;|vote Yes/No| TM&#10;  TM --&gt;|Phase 2: commit/rollback| RM1&#10;  TM --&gt;|Phase 2: commit/rollback| RM2&#10;  TM --&gt;|Phase 2: commit/rollback| RM3\">graph TD\n  TM[协调者 / TM&lt;br/&gt;发起 · 收集投票 · 广播决定 · 持久化日志]\n  RM1[参与者 1 / RM · 本地库 A&lt;br/&gt;写 undo/redo · 持锁等待]\n  RM2[参与者 2 / RM · 本地库 B&lt;br/&gt;写 undo/redo · 持锁等待]\n  RM3[参与者 3 / RM · 消息队列&lt;br/&gt;写日志 · 持锁等待]\n  TM --&gt;|Phase 1: prepare?| RM1\n  TM --&gt;|Phase 1: prepare?| RM2\n  TM --&gt;|Phase 1: prepare?| RM3\n  RM1 --&gt;|vote Yes/No| TM\n  RM2 --&gt;|vote Yes/No| TM\n  RM3 --&gt;|vote Yes/No| TM\n  TM --&gt;|Phase 2: commit/rollback| RM1\n  TM --&gt;|Phase 2: commit/rollback| RM2\n  TM --&gt;|Phase 2: commit/rollback| RM3</pre><p>协调者的职责有四条：<strong>发起</strong>（业务完成后启动协议）、<strong>收集</strong>（汇总投票判定全局结果）、<strong>持久化</strong>（把全局决定写入日志——崩溃恢复的唯一凭据）、<strong>驱动完成</strong>（重发决定直到所有参与者确认）。参与者则要<strong>落盘</strong>（把足以重做或撤销的日志与数据写到稳定存储）、<strong>投票</strong>（诚实报告本地能否提交）、<strong>锁定</strong>（投 Yes 后保持资源锁直到被裁决）、<strong>可恢复</strong>（重启后从本地日志读回 prepared 状态并等待协调者）。一个被低估的设计点是<strong>参与者必须把决定状态本身也持久化</strong>：PostgreSQL 在 prepare 时「事务状态被完整存储在磁盘上，即使数据库崩溃也能以极高概率成功提交」（<a href=\"https://www.postgresql.org/docs/current/sql-prepare-transaction.html\">PostgreSQL</a>）——没有它，重启后的事务就成了孤儿。</p>\n<h2 id=\"两阶段的具体协议流程\">两阶段的具体协议流程</h2><p><strong>Phase 1（prepare）</strong>：协调者向每个参与者发送 <code>PREPARE</code>。参与者在本地事务中执行业务写入但<strong>不提交</strong>，把 undo 日志、redo 日志和锁全部保持在事务上下文中，写一条 prepared 记录，然后回投票。MySQL 的 XA 状态机把这一步拆成 <code>ACTIVE → IDLE → PREPARED</code> 三态：<code>XA START</code> 进入 ACTIVE，业务 SQL 后 <code>XA END</code> 进入 IDLE，<code>XA PREPARE</code> 才进入 PREPARED（<a href=\"https://dev.mysql.com/doc/refman/8.4/en/xa-states.html\">MySQL XA Transaction States</a>）。区分 ACTIVE 与 IDLE 的意义是：ACTIVE 态下不允许执行任何会引发隐式提交的语句，违者报 <code>XAER_RMFAIL: The command cannot be executed when global transaction is in the ACTIVE state</code>——这保证了「参与者不会在投票前偷偷把事务提交掉」。</p>\n<p><strong>Phase 2（commit/rollback）</strong>：协调者收到全部投票。全 Yes 则发 <code>COMMIT PREPARED</code> / <code>XA COMMIT</code>；有任一 No 或超时则发 <code>ROLLBACK PREPARED</code> / <code>XA ROLLBACK</code>。参与者执行后释放锁并回执。能否接管 in-doubt 事务取决于实现：MySQL 8.4 默认 <code>xa_detach_on_prepare=ON</code>，prepared 事务在 <code>XA PREPARE</code> 后**脱离（detach）**当前会话，可由另一连接收尾；PostgreSQL 则规定 <code>COMMIT PREPARED</code> / <code>ROLLBACK PREPARED</code>「可以从任何会话发出，而不仅是执行原事务的那个会话」（<a href=\"https://www.postgresql.org/docs/current/sql-prepare-transaction.html\">PostgreSQL</a>、<a href=\"https://dev.mysql.com/doc/refman/8.4/en/xa-states.html\">MySQL XA Transaction States</a>）。这是协调者故障切换后仍能把事务推向终态的基础，也是 <code>XA RECOVER</code> 能列出 PREPARED 事务供运维裁决的原因。随之而来的约束是标识符：PostgreSQL 要求全局事务 ID <strong>短于 200 字节</strong>且不与现存标识符重复（<a href=\"https://www.postgresql.org/docs/current/sql-prepare-transaction.html\">PostgreSQL</a>）。</p>\n<h2 id=\"阻塞窗口从哪来-有多长\">阻塞窗口从哪来、有多长</h2><p>阻塞窗口可精确定义为参与者从<strong>投出 Yes 的那一刻</strong>起，到<strong>收到并执行最终决定</strong>为止的时长。在最坏路径（协调者在发出决定前崩溃）下：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>T</mi><mrow><mi>b</mi><mi>l</mi><mi>o</mi><mi>c</mi><mi>k</mi></mrow></msub><mtext>  </mtext><mo>≈</mo><mtext>  </mtext><msub><mi>T</mi><mrow><mi>d</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>t</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>c</mi><mi>t</mi></mrow></msub><mtext>  </mtext><mo>+</mo><mtext>  </mtext><msub><mi>T</mi><mrow><mi>r</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>c</mi><mi>o</mi><mi>v</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>r</mi></mrow></msub><mtext>  </mtext><mo>+</mo><mtext>  </mtext><msub><mi>T</mi><mrow><mi>p</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>r</mi><mi>s</mi><mi>i</mi><mi>s</mi><mi>t</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">T_{block} \\;\\approx\\; T_{detect} \\;+\\; T_{recover} \\;+\\; T_{persist}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">b</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0197em;\">l</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">oc</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≈</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">d</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">e</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">ec</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">eco</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">v</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">er</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9694em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">p</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">er</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">s</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">s</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>T</mi><mrow><mi>d</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>t</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>c</mi><mi>t</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">T_{detect}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">d</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">e</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">ec</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 是检测协调者失效的时间（心跳超时、租约到期），<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>T</mi><mrow><mi>r</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>c</mi><mi>o</mi><mi>v</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>r</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">T_{recover}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">eco</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">v</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">er</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 是新协调者从日志恢复决定并重发的时间，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>T</mi><mrow><mi>p</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>r</mi><mi>s</mi><mi>i</mi><mi>s</mi><mi>t</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">T_{persist}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9694em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">p</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">er</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">s</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">s</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 是参与者落实决定并释放锁的时间。三项里 <strong><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>T</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">_</mi><mrow><mi>d</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>t</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>c</mi><mi>t</mi></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">T\\_{detect}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0044em;vertical-align:-0.31em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"mord\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">_</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">d</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">e</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">ec</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span></span></span></span></span></span> 通常占绝对多数</strong>，因为它是超时阈值的函数，而超时阈值为了抗抖动往往被设得很保守。</p>\n<p>危害不只是「慢」，而是<strong>锁的资源放大效应</strong>。in-doubt 的参与者在 PostgreSQL 里继续持有原有的所有锁，阻塞后继事务、阻碍 <code>VACUUM</code>（<a href=\"https://www.postgresql.org/docs/current/sql-prepare-transaction.html\">PostgreSQL</a>）。几十个这样的 prepared 事务挂在同一热点表上，整个库的写入就会被拖垮。所以 PostgreSQL 的运维建议极其强硬：<strong>如果没有外部事务管理器跟踪 prepared 事务并保证其及时收尾，最好把 <code>max_prepared_transactions</code> 设为 0，直接关闭这个特性</strong>（默认值正是 0，<a href=\"https://www.postgresql.org/docs/current/runtime-config-resource.html\">PostgreSQL Resource Configuration</a>）。MySQL 侧更微妙：<code>xa_detach_on_prepare</code> 默认 ON 降低了会话阻塞，代价是孤儿 prepared 事务更易长期留存——必须有 <code>XA RECOVER</code> 巡检 + 定时裁决的闭环。</p>\n<h2 id=\"收缩阻塞窗口的三条工程路径\">收缩阻塞窗口的三条工程路径</h2><p>阻塞窗口是 2PC 的固有属性，但可以被显著压缩。业界有三条互相独立、可以叠加的路径。</p>\n<p><strong>路径一：把协调者做高可用。</strong> 阻塞的根源是协调者单点。把决定日志复制到多数派、让备用节点在原协调者失效后接管，就能把 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>T</mi><mrow><mi>r</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>c</mi><mi>o</mi><mi>v</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>r</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">T_{recover}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">eco</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">v</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">er</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 压到秒级。这一路径不改变协议本身，只消除「协调者永久失效」这一最坏情形。</p>\n<p><strong>路径二：从「两轮共识」压到「一轮」。</strong> CockroachDB 的 <strong>Parallel Commits</strong> 是代表。它把事务状态记录设为 <code>PENDING / STAGING / COMMITTED / ABORTED</code> 四态：提交时先把记录置为 <code>STAGING</code> 并记下在途写入集合，然后<strong>不等记录翻成 COMMITTED</strong>，只要在途写入全部达成共识，事务就已「隐式提交（implicitly committed）」——「任何观察到该事务的节点都能验证其写入已复制」，客户端可见的提交延迟因此「从两轮共识降到一轮」（<a href=\"https://docs.cockroachlabs.com/docs/stable/architecture/transaction-layer\">CockroachDB Transaction Layer</a>）。协调者随后异步地把记录改成 COMMITTED。恢复也不再单靠协调者：另一节点检查 <code>STAGING</code> 记录、逐个判定列出的写入是否已达成共识——这条路径「只有在事务协调者因意外崩溃时才使用」（<a href=\"https://docs.cockroachlabs.com/docs/stable/architecture/transaction-layer\">CockroachDB</a>）。</p>\n<p><strong>路径三：换协议，绕开阻塞。</strong> <strong>三阶段提交（3PC）</strong> 在 prepare 与 commit 之间插入一个 <code>pre-commit</code> 阶段，且「协调者在所有团体成员都 ACK 表示已准备好提交之前，不会发出 doCommit 消息」。于是协调者在 preCommit 前失效则全体判定中止，在 preCommit 后失效则恢复协调者可安全推向提交——「消除了提交阶段某一类特定失败所导致的无限阻塞」（<a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Three-phase_commit_protocol\">Three-phase commit protocol, Wikipedia</a>）。但代价是<strong>每事务至少三轮往返</strong>且要求有界网络延迟；Skeen 原始版的 3PC 在真实分区下仍可能出现「多数派已连通却无法推进」，需 E3PC 扩展（<a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Three-phase_commit_protocol\">Wikipedia</a>）。因此生产系统极少直接上 3PC，更多走路径一、二，或改用不阻塞的补偿型协议。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>2PC 把节点分为一个协调者与多个参与者；参与者行为受 X/Open XA 规范约束，MySQL 中服务器是 RM、客户端是 TM，协调者往往就是业务进程本身。</li>\n<li>协议分投票与决定两阶段：参与者投 Yes 前必须先落盘 undo/redo 并保持锁；PostgreSQL 用 <code>PREPARE TRANSACTION</code>、MySQL 用 <code>XA PREPARE</code> 进入 PREPARED 态，后者默认可从其他连接收尾。</li>\n<li><strong>2PC 的本质缺陷是阻塞</strong>：投 Yes 后到收到决定之间参与者处于 in-doubt，无法自行了结；协调者永久失效会导致资源永久占用。</li>\n<li>阻塞窗口 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>T</mi><mrow><mi>b</mi><mi>l</mi><mi>o</mi><mi>c</mi><mi>k</mi></mrow></msub><mo>≈</mo><msub><mi>T</mi><mrow><mi>d</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>t</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>c</mi><mi>t</mi></mrow></msub><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>T</mi><mrow><mi>r</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>c</mi><mi>o</mi><mi>v</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>r</mi></mrow></msub><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>T</mi><mrow><mi>p</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>r</mi><mi>s</mi><mi>i</mi><mi>s</mi><mi>t</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">T_{block} \\approx T_{detect} + T_{recover} + T_{persist}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">b</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0197em;\">l</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">oc</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≈</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">d</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">e</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">ec</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">eco</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">v</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">er</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9694em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">p</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">er</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">s</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">s</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>T</mi><mrow><mi>d</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>t</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>c</mi><mi>t</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">T_{detect}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">d</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">e</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">ec</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 通常主导。</li>\n<li>收缩窗口三条路径：协调者高可用、并行提交（CockroachDB 把两轮共识压到一轮）、换协议（3PC，代价至少三轮往返与更强的网络假设）。</li>\n<li>运维铁律：若不管理 prepared 事务，就把 PostgreSQL 的 <code>max_prepared_transactions</code> 保持为默认的 0；若启用，则必须建立 <code>XA RECOVER</code> 巡检与超时裁决闭环。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>「超时即不确定态」的根源见同 hub 的 <a href=\"../consistency-models-and-problem/distributed-failure-model\">分布式事务的故障模型</a>；2PC 与补偿型协议（Saga、TCC）的取舍边界见 <a href=\"../consistency-models-and-problem/consistency-spectrum-and-base\">一致性谱系与 BASE</a>。</p>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"2PC 内部机制：协调者、参与者与阻塞窗口","id":"2pc-内部机制-协调者-参与者与阻塞窗口"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"协调者与参与者的角色分工","id":"协调者与参与者的角色分工"},{"level":2,"text":"两阶段的具体协议流程","id":"两阶段的具体协议流程"},{"level":2,"text":"阻塞窗口从哪来、有多长","id":"阻塞窗口从哪来-有多长"},{"level":2,"text":"收缩阻塞窗口的三条工程路径","id":"收缩阻塞窗口的三条工程路径"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"分布式事务的故障模型：超时、分区与部分失败","url":"/l-doc-books/h/backend-engineering/distributed-transaction-consistency-patterns/consistency-models-and-problem/distributed-failure-model"},"next":{"title":"XA 协议与事务管理器的工程实现","url":"/l-doc-books/h/backend-engineering/distributed-transaction-consistency-patterns/commit-protocols-2pc-tcc/xa-and-transaction-manager"}}